        role: "Vape shop clerk",
        exam: [.direct("What happened at your vape shop on {DATE}?", "\"A person pointed what looked like a black pistol at me and took $380 from the register. I believed it was a real gun.\""), .direct("What does the shop camera show?", "\"A person pointing a black pistol at me, with a jacket and shoes clearly visible. The face was partly covered.\""), .direct("What was found?", "\"{D} was found that evening with the jacket and an airsoft pistol, its orange tip painted black. It was in {D}'s car.\""), .direct("Please describe your job at the vape shop.", "\"I work the register at a vape shop, mostly evenings. I know the regulars, I count the drawer at close, and I am usually alone near closing time.\""), .direct("Describe the moment the person came in.", "\"Around nine, a person in a dark jacket walked in, pulled out what looked like a black pistol, and pointed it at me. I froze and did what I was told.\""), .direct("What did the person say and do?", "\"I was told to open the register and step back. I gave over $380 from the drawer, and the person left quickly and ran toward the parking lot.\""), .cross("It was an airsoft gun, wasn't it?", "\"I know that now. At the time it looked completely real, and I was terrified.\""), .cross("{DL} says it was a dare from friends, doesn't {D.he}?", "\"It didn't feel like a joke at my register.\""), .cross("Was any money returned?", "\"I'm told some money came back. I'd need to check the amount. It wasn't all.\""), .cross("Could you tell whether the pistol was real?", "\"No. It looked like a real black handgun to me. I did not know until the deputies told me later that it was an airsoft gun.\""), .cross("Did the person hurt you or threaten to shoot?", "\"No one touched me. The pistol was pointed at me the whole time, and I was afraid I would be shot if I hesitated.\"")],
