        openings: ("Someone held scissors to a vape shop clerk at closing and took $340. A customer recognized {D} from the video, and a hoodie matching the video was found in {D}'s possession.", "By the end of this trial, the proof will show that a transit card places {D} on a bus at 9:50, two miles away, and that the hoodie is a common style."),
