        defendant: [.direct("Where were you at 5 a.m.?", "\"Asleep at home. I don't get up that early. I wasn't at that shop.\""), .direct("Did you rob {V}?", "\"No. I was fired, and I was angry, but I'd never rob anyone with a gun.\""), .direct("Describe the time you worked at the roaster in your own words.", "\"I worked there for a few years, roasting and loading. I was good at the job, and I was upset when I was let go two months before.\""), .direct("Why do you limp?", "\"I hurt my leg in an old accident years ago. A medical note documents it, and plenty of people know me by that limp.\""), .direct("Where were you at five that morning?", "\"I was asleep at home. I do not get up that early since I lost the job. Nobody was with me, so I have no one to confirm it.\""), .direct("How did your employment at the roaster end?", "\"I was let go after an argument about hours. I was angry for a while, and I told a coworker I would not be back, but I never threatened anyone.\""), .cross("You were fired two months earlier, weren't you?", "\"Yes. I was upset. I didn't take it out on {V}.\""), .cross("A revolver was found near your street, wasn't it?", "\"That's what they say. I don't know whose it is.\""), .cross("Nobody can say you were asleep, can they?", "\"No. I live alone. I know that's not much.\""), .cross("You asked a coworker what time the shop opened, didn't you?", "\"Yes, I did. I was curious whether my old shift was filled. It was a casual question, and I did not mean anything by it.\""), .cross("You owned a revolver of the same caliber, didn't you?", "\"I owned one years ago and I do not have it now. Many people own that caliber, and I did not use it on anyone.\"")],
